# NETWORK TOOLS

Registered tools for the network domain:
- discover_hosts — enumerate hosts/services within the authorized
  scope (low risk, read-only).
- fingerprint_service — identify service versions on discovered
  hosts (elevated risk, read-only).
- port_scan — probe exposure on discovered hosts (high risk;
  step-confirm required before execution).
- tls_inspect — inspect TLS certificates on exposed services
  (elevated risk, read-only).

Execute in investigation order: discover → fingerprint → (on
approval) probe → inspect. High-risk tools are proposed to the
analyst and executed only after step confirmation. Never run a
tool against a target outside the authorized scope.
